acter lighting, and a bold gritty masthead reading THE BOYS.", "A dark premium studio backdrop mixed with a distressed American flag motif, subtle smoke, sparks, torn fabric texture, faint city lights, and cinematic haze. The background is clean enough for magazine typography and keeps the focus on the two characters.", "photo", "", "Vertical 3:4 magazine cover composition, sharp facial detail, realistic skin texture, premium print quality, shallow depth of field, powerful symmetrical character layout.", "High-end glossy magazine cover, prestige TV key art, dark satirical superhero drama, luxury editorial poster, cinematic realism, sophisticated print design.", "Dramatic studio lighting with hard rim lights, red and blue split lighting, soft smoke haze, metallic highlights on costumes, strong shadow contrast.", "[\"#0B1020\",\"#8B1E1E\",\"#D9B75F\",\"#F3E9D2\",\"#1E3A5F\"]", "[{\"w\":0.7,\"x\":0.15,\"h\":0.115,\"y\":0.035,\"palette\":[\"#B91C1C\",\"#F3E9D2\"],\"text\":\"THE BOYS\",\"type\":\"text\",\"desc\":\"Large masthead title at the top, bold distressed block lettering, gritty red and off-white logo-like magazine style, centered, highly readable, strong impact.\"},{\"w\":0.435,\"x\":0.07,\"h\":0.735,\"y\":0.175,\"palette\":[],\"text\":\"\",\"type\":\"obj\",\"desc\":\"home_lander, blond clean-cut arrogant patriotic superhero, blue and red suit with cape, polished costume texture, cold confident smile, standing slightly forward on the left side, looking directly at the viewer, dominant and unsettling.\"},{\"w\":0.435,\"x\":0.5,\"h\":0.725,\"y\":0.205,\"palette\":[],\"text\":\"\",\"type\":\"obj\",\"desc\":\"soldier_boy, rugged dark-haired military-style patriotic superhero, green tactical suit, shield held low at his side, cynical serious expression, rough masculine posture, standing on the right side, clearly separated from home_lander.\"},{\"w\":0.39,\"x\":0.08,\"h\":0.075,\"y\":0.735,\"palette\":[\"#F3E9D2\"],\"text\":\"HOMELANDER VS SOLDIER BOY\",\"type\":\"tex